<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/msa@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Menteri hendaklah melantik seorang pekhidmat awam menjadi Ketua Pengarah Rukun Tetangga."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/msa@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/msa@/~part_II__cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/msa@> .
